<title>GERMANY: Strabag announces management reshuffle.</title>
<headline>Strabag announces management reshuffle.</headline>
<dateline>COLOGNE, Germany 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>German construction group Strabag AG said on Thursday that its management board chairman would step down at the end to this year and be replaced by the group's finance director.</p>
<p>Management board chairman Otmar Franz, 62, will retire at the end of this year, Strabag said in a mandatory statment to the German bourse.</p>
<p>He will be replaced by finance chief Juergen Kuchenwald, who will also retain his position as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
